This is console utility for preparing a diary for measurements sugar level in the blood.
It have a dialog for choosing diary type. The diary writing to the output.txt. Main data writing to the input.json. If this file not exist, it creating with default data.
Now there is diary types:
- 2 measurements per day
- 2 measurements per day with work cycle 2/2
- 5 measurements per week
- 5 measurements per week with work cycle 2/2
- 5 measurements per week with work cycle 3/3
